rk3588-board-rock-5a (0.1.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Initial board support package for the stock Ubuntu kernel: unwrap the
    kernel for U-Boot booti, register the board with flash-kernel, boot the
    stock kernel's own DTB, load the Rockchip MMC drivers in the initramfs
    and enable panthor GPU profiling.
  * Ship our own DTB, built from the upstream DTS with -@ (symbols), so the
    camera overlays can apply; Ubuntu's DTB has no __symbols__.

 -- Peyton Howe <peyton@localhost>  Sun, 08 Nov 2026 12:00:00 +0000
